SUMMARY:Deadline 23:59 EST: Folger Institute Artistic Research Fellowships 
 2027-28 (USD 4\,000 to 5\,000 per month)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 15 Jan 2027 at 23:59 EST.\n\nArtistic research fellowshi
 ps for artists whose work needs primary research on the early modern world
  (about 1400 to 1800) and its legacies\, using the Folger's collections. E
 LIGIBILITY: any artist\; no degree required and no citizenship rule stated
 . OFFER: USD 4\,000 per virtual month or USD 5\,000 per onsite month for o
 ne to three months\; no studio is provided.\n\nOrganisation: Folger Shakes
 peare Library (Folger Institute)\nLocation: Washington DC\, USA\, or virtu
 al/hybrid.\nAward: USD 4\,000 per virtual month or USD 5\,000 per onsite m
 onth.\nDuration: 1 to 3 months between 1 July 2027 and 30 June 2028\n\nMor
 e: https://www.folger.edu/research/the-folger-institute/fellowships/apply-
 for-a-fellowship/artistic-research-fellowships/?utm_source=artificialnouve
 augrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.folger.edu/research/the-folger-institute/fellowships/apply-
 for-a-fellowship/artistic-research-fellowships/?utm_source=artificialnouve
 augrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Washington DC\, USA\, or virtual/hybrid.
END:VEVENT
