SUMMARY:Deadline 18:00 Hong Kong time: HKADC Emerging Artists Development G
 rant (up to HKD 90\,000\, Hong Kong arts graduates)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 31 Dec 2026 at 18:00 Hong Kong time.\n\nThe Hong Kong Ar
 ts Development Council's Emerging Artists Development Grant funds a first 
 arts project by recent graduates: performances\, exhibitions\, publication
 s\, creation of artwork\, translation and other project types allowed unde
 r its general Project Grant.\n\nOrganisation: Hong Kong Arts Development C
 ouncil (HKADC)\nLocation: Hong Kong. Individual applicants must hold a Hon
 g Kong identity card and have graduated from an arts and culture course (l
 ocal or overseas tertiary institution\, associate degree included) within 
 the last five school years\; Hong Kong registered organisations whose offi
 ce-bearers are at least half such emerging artists may also apply.\nAward:
  Grant ceiling HKD 90\,000 per project (HKADC may exceed the ceiling for p
 rojects of great potential\, subject to resources). No application fee sta
 ted.\nDuration: Per project\n\nMore: https://www.hkadc.org.hk/en/grants-an
 d-scholarship/grants/project-grant?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&u
 tm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.hkadc.org.hk/en/grants-and-scholarship/grants/project-grant
 ?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Hong Kong. Individual applicants must hold a Hong Kong identity ca
 rd and have graduated from an arts and culture course (local or overseas t
 ertiary institution\, associate degree included) within the last five scho
 ol years\; Hong Kong registered organisations whose office-bearers are at 
 least half such emerging artists may also apply.
END:VEVENT
