 ollaborations and Pluralism (up to EUR 2-2.5 million per project)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 04 Feb 2027 at 17:00 CET.\n\nCreative Europe's Journalis
 m Partnerships call (CREA-CROSS-2027-JOURPART) has two topics supporting t
 he news media sector. COLLABORATIONS funds cross-border collaboration and 
 business transformation among news media organisations\; consortia need at
  least three independent entities from three eligible countries.\n\nOrgani
 sation: Creative Europe Cross-sectoral strand (European Commission / EACEA
 )\nLocation: EU Member States and countries associated to Creative Europe.
  For organisations (legal entities) established in an eligible country\; n
 atural persons cannot apply.\nAward: Total EUR 14\,000\,000 (EUR 7\,000\,0
 00 per topic). Collaborations: up to EUR 2\,000\,000 per project at 80 per
 cent funding. Pluralism: up to EUR 2\,500\,000 per project at 90 percent f
 unding\, with re-granting of up to EUR 60\,000 per third party. No applica
 tion fee.\nDuration: Projects normally up to 24 months. Call opened 22 Oct
 ober 2026.\n\nMore: https://ec.europa.eu/info/funding-tenders/opportunitie
 s/portal/screen/opportunities/topic-details/CREA-CROSS-2027-JOURPART-PLURA
 LISM?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://ec.europa.eu/info/funding-tenders/opportunities/portal/screen/o
 pportunities/topic-details/CREA-CROSS-2027-JOURPART-PLURALISM?utm_source=a
 rtificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:EU Member States and countries associated to Creative Europe. For 
 organisations (legal entities) established in an eligible country\; natura
 l persons cannot apply.
END:VEVENT
